@startuml
title Service order decomposition fallout - Order fallout creation

participant "Event\nManagement" as Event #grey
participant "Fallout\nManagement" as FM #lightgrey

note left of Event : continued from\nchapter 5.2.1.1

Event -> FM : 1 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/serviceOrderException
activate FM
FM --> Event : 2 **TMF688** 201 Created

FM -> FM : 3 Create fallout

FM -> Event : 4 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutCreate (falloutId, state="Created")
