FM -> FM : 6 Update fallout\n(state="Processing/Analysing")

FM -> Event : 7 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutStateChange (falloutId, "Processing/Analysing")
Event --> FM : 8 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate FM

note right of FM : continuation in\nchapter 5.2.1.4

@enduml
